      en: "1) Click an enemy rank on the right to target it, then execute a tactical skill (Torch Knight Smite, Point Blank Shot, Plague Grenade, Lantern Nun Comfort, or Inspiring Cry). 2) Torchlight drops by 5 each turn: low light (<25%) increases enemy Stress damage by 40% but doubles gold loot. 3) At 100 Stress, a hero undergoes a Resolve Check — rolling either Virtuous (Stress reset to 45 & +6 ATK) or Afflicted.",
